menu "Benchmark local board"

    config EXAMPLE_LCD_FRAME_BUFFERS
        int "GC9503 native LCD frame buffers"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S31
        range 2 3
        default 2
        help
            Two framebuffers select the presenter's DOUBLE_PARTIAL contract.
            Three uses AUTO and costs one
            additional 480 * 480 * 2-byte PSRAM framebuffer.

endmenu
